#: style.css
msgid "A complete rental-business website theme designed for the Project Prepper plugin — equipment list, availability check and request form out of the box. Block theme with full site editing support."
msgstr "Ein komplettes Website-Theme für Verleih-Anbieter, gestaltet für das Project-Prepper-Plugin — Equipment-Liste, Verfügbarkeits-Check und Anfrage-Formular direkt einsatzbereit. Block-Theme mit vollem Site-Editor-Support."

